  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 10 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nThe instructions are clear - this exceptional Orakei residence must be sold. With the deadline set, now is the time to make your move.\r\n\r\nElevated above Orakei Basin with breathtaking panoramic views stretching across the water to the city skyline, this remarkable home delivers luxury, scale and an outstanding family lifestyle.\r\n\r\nBuilt just seven years ago as the builder’s own residence, this substantial 349m² home unfolds across three beautifully considered levels, all connected by an internal lift.\r\n\r\nThe lower level provides exceptional accommodation for family and guests, with three generous double bedrooms, each enjoying its own en-suite. A separate family lounge opens seamlessly to a private courtyard with a LouvreTec system and built-in pizza oven - the perfect setting for relaxed entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, expansive open-plan living and dining flow effortlessly onto covered decking, where spectacular water and city views take centre stage. A feature gas fireplace, generous entertainer’s kitchen with double ovens and a full scullery, and an additional lounge create an inviting space for everyday living and entertaining on any scale.\r\n\r\nCrowning the home, the entire upper level is dedicated to the primary suite - a luxurious private retreat with uninterrupted panoramic views, expansive private decking, a walk-in wardrobe and an elegant en-suite.\r\n\r\nSeven heat pumps, integrated sound, abundant storage and internal-access garaging for three vehicles (including a car stacker) complete this impressive residence.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Orakei Bay Village, the train station, the CBD and the Eastern Bays, this is an exceptional opportunity to secure a home that combines luxury, convenience and an unforgettable outlook.\r\n\r\nThe owners are motivated and committed to achieving a result before Christmas. Don't let this opportunity pass you by.\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale: 2 pm, Thursday, 10 December 2026 (unless sold prior).",
